OL,3,AI paid #30,000 for an 'influencer'
OL,4,Adegree. Here's why
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs university courses go it may raise a
OL,7,Ffew eyebrows, but Destiny McGowan has
OL,8,Fno doubt that hers was very useful.
OL,10,FIn July the 21-year-old graduated from
OL,11,FNottingham Trent University with a
OL,12,Fdegree in content creation.
OL,14,FAs well as teaching how to best make
OL,15,Fvideos and posts for Instagram, TikTok
OL,16,Fand YouTube, the course also focused on
OL,17,Fhow to build audiences, engage with
OL,18,Fbrands and monetise your content.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,165,160,200,105,0,100
