OL,3,AI paid #30,000 for an 'influencer'
OL,4,Adegree. Here's why
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I always wanted to be an entrepreneur,
OL,7,Fso for me the course was about the
OL,8,Ftransferable skills that I believed I
OL,9,Fwould gain," says Destiny, pointing to
OL,10,Fboth the social media and business
OL,11,Faspects she was taught.
